description: git-issue's setup-sync fetches notes with +refs/notes/*:refs/notes/*, so a fetch or pull force-replaces a local issue ref and drops unpushed local edits (reproduced 2026-10-10 in scratch clones; tracked in nnunley/git-issue-tracker as #e2dfdaa). Lost edits survive only in the reflog: git reflog show refs/notes/issue-<id>.
